"using the error handling defined by *errors*. Both can be ``NULL`` to "
"have the interface use the default values (see :ref:`builtincodecs` for "
"details)."
msgstr ""
":class:`bytes`, :class:`bytearray` 및 기타 :term:`바이트열류 객체 <bytes-like "
